{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape Blast</strong> is a short arcade roguelike where you control two paddles, bouncing a ball between them as you face waves of enemy shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squares are your main enemies \u2014 your mission is to stop them from reaching the left and right edges of the screen. If too many slip through, you\u2019ll lose lives and risk a game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.poster.avif?t=1756172507\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.webm?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/3819677300e589c0a93dbd656d15b249.mp4?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Create Your Build:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy geometric shapes to earn points and unlock powerful upgrades. With over 30 unique upgrades, each run lets you customize your build with different abilities and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.poster.avif?t=1756172507\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.webm?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/8bd2067d286dacc8d6c6dabdcddab3ae.mp4?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of the available upgrades include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing ball size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating a freezing zone that paralyzes squares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doubling the points you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipping a laser on your paddle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing your max life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firing diagonal projectiles from the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Installing an ice jet on your paddle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching multiple balls at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 20 rounds to win the game. After finishing, you unlock Infinite Mode \u2014 an endless challenge to test your ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player &amp; Local Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, controlling both paddles yourself, or team up with a friend in local co-op where each player controls one paddle. Work together to face the waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.poster.avif?t=1756172507\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.webm?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780730/extras/1740b46a71e4cd0d6e623e9cc74e1fba.mp4?t=1756172507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780730?t=1756172507","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea